app_hex:
	This folder store application .hex file: app.version.major.minor.hex,
this folder will be copy and rename to rootfs/mcu.
	app.1.xx.xx.hex for Microchip.
	app.2.xx.xx.bin for ST.

boot_hex:
	This folder store bootloader .hex file: boot.major.minor.hex,
	boot.1.xx.hex for Microchio.
	boot.2.xx.bin for ST.

intact_hex:
	In this folder, bootloader and aplication in one hex file,
Factories use this file burning MCU.
	factory.1.xx.xx.hex for Microchip.
	factory.2.xx.xx.bin for ST.


mz1024efe100:
	This folder include Bootloader code and Application code for Microchip.

stm32f446:
	This folder include Bootlaoder code and Application code for ST.
